msgid "导出的拼接 PNG 如下。上排对照整图，下排对照同一个窗框；图中保留了来源标题和取样框。"
msgstr "The exported stitch is shown below. Compare the full images above and the same window detail below. Titles and sampling boxes are included."

msgid "![拼接输出 PNG：左列原图、右列 Gaussian Blur，下排为两列各自的放大细节](../media/paper-comparison.png)"
msgstr "![Exported PNG: original on the left, Gaussian Blur on the right, corresponding detail crops below](../media/paper-comparison.png)"

#: ../../resources/usage.md:1
msgid "图像与视频浏览"
msgstr "Browse images and videos"

#: ../../resources/usage.md:3
msgid "第一次并排播放两段视频"
msgstr "Play two videos side by side"

#: ../../resources/usage.md:7
msgid "展开右侧 **Input & Playback**，勾选 **Video mode**。在工具栏选择 **Parallel auto**。"
msgstr "Expand **Input & Playback**, enable **Video mode**, and choose **Parallel auto** on the toolbar."

#: ../../resources/usage.md:8
msgid ""
"在 **Layout & Display** 将 **Page** 设为 `1,2`（一行两列），**Per source** 设为 `1,1`。在 **Input & Playback** "
"取消 **Multiple frames per source** 和 **Play sources sequentially**。"
msgstr ""
"In **Layout & Display**, set **Page** to `1,2` (one row, two columns) and **Per source** to "
"`1,1`. In **Input & Playback**, clear **Multiple frames per source** and **Play sources "
"sequentially**."

#: ../../resources/usage.md:9
msgid "点击工具栏的文件夹，选择仓库中的 `docs/media/example-videos`。按 **Ctrl+R** 应用布局。左格为猫咪（Cat.mp4），右格为海上日落（Sunset.mp4）。在线阅读时可下载 [Cat.mp4](../media/example-videos/Cat.mp4) 和 [Sunset.mp4](../media/example-videos/Sunset.mp4)，放入同一空目录后打开。"
msgstr "Click the toolbar folder and open `docs/media/example-videos` in the repository. Press **Ctrl+R** to apply the layout. Cat.mp4 appears on the left and Sunset.mp4 on the right. If reading online, download [Cat.mp4](../media/example-videos/Cat.mp4) and [Sunset.mp4](../media/example-videos/Sunset.mp4) into one empty folder and open it."

#: ../../resources/usage.md:10
msgid "点 **>** 后点 **▶** 向前播放；点 **<** 后再点 **▶** 则向后播放。按 **Esc** 暂停。页码从 1 开始，可用滑块跳转。修改多个布局或算法参数后，统一刷新即可。"
msgstr ""
"Click **>** then **▶** to play forward, or **<** then **▶** to play backward. Press **Esc** to "
"pause. Page numbers start at 1. Drag the slider to jump. After editing several layout or "
"algorithm settings, refresh once to apply them together."

#: ../../resources/usage.md:12
msgid "![并行播放示例：每一页保留左右两个来源，同时更新帧](../media/parallel-playback.gif)"
msgstr "![Parallel playback with both sources advancing on each page](../media/parallel-playback.gif)"

#: ../../resources/usage.md:12
msgid "并行播放示例：每一页保留左右两个来源，同时更新帧"
msgstr "Parallel playback with both sources advancing on each page"

#: ../../resources/usage.md:14
msgid ""
"要复现动图的尺寸，在 **Layout & Display** 将 **Display scale** 设为 `1,1`（两个演示片段均为 416 × 416），**Gaps (X,Y for "
"each level)** 填 `8,8,6,6,0,0,0,0,0,0`，勾选 **Image**、**Title** 和 **Fit window to image**，取消 "
"**Magnifier**，在 **Titles** 保留 **Auto title**，再按 **Ctrl+R**。画布中应出现 Cat、Sunset "
"两个标题；较矮的窗口可滚动右栏查看其余参数。动图逐页展示前五页，帧间停留时间用于阅读。"
msgstr ""
"To match the animation, set **Display scale** to `1,1` in **Layout & Display** (both clips are "
"416 × 416). Enter `8,8,6,6,0,0,0,0,0,0` for **Gaps (X,Y for each level)**. Enable **Image**, "
"**Title**, and **Fit window to image**, clear **Magnifier**, leave **Titles → Auto title** "
"enabled, and press **Ctrl+R**. The titles should read Cat and Sunset. Scroll the sidebar in a "
"shorter window. The animation pauses on each of the first five pages for readability."

#: ../../resources/usage.md:18
msgid "选对输入和布局"
msgstr "Choose an input mode and layout"

