msgid "单个图像目录"
msgstr "One image folder"

#: ../../resources/usage.md
msgid "单个视频文件"
msgstr "One video file"

#: ../../resources/usage.md
msgid "浏览一组照片或检查一个视频"
msgstr "Browse a photo set or inspect one video."

#: ../../resources/usage.md
msgid "Parallel auto"
msgstr ""

#: ../../resources/usage.md
msgid "含多个来源子目录的父目录"
msgstr "A parent folder containing source folders"

#: ../../resources/usage.md
msgid "含多个视频的目录"
msgstr "A folder containing multiple videos"

#: ../../resources/usage.md
msgid "同一位置对照；图像来源宜使用对应文件名"
msgstr "Compare corresponding positions. Matching filenames across image sources work best."

#: ../../resources/usage.md
msgid "Parallel manual"
msgstr ""

#: ../../resources/usage.md
msgid "逐个选择来源目录"
msgstr "Choose source folders individually"

#: ../../resources/usage.md
msgid "逐个选择视频"
msgstr "Choose videos individually"

#: ../../resources/usage.md
msgid "只比较部分来源或调整来源顺序"
msgstr "Compare a subset of sources or change their order."

#: ../../resources/usage.md
msgid "Image/Video File List"
msgstr ""

#: ../../resources/usage.md
msgid "指定图片清单"
msgstr "An image file list"

#: ../../resources/usage.md
msgid "指定视频清单"
msgstr "A video file list"

#: ../../resources/usage.md
msgid "重现固定输入。可从仓库的 `auto_test_scripts/assets/lists/` 打开 TXT 示例，相对路径以清单所在目录为基准；也支持 CSV"
msgstr ""
"Reopen a fixed selection. Try a TXT example from `auto_test_scripts/assets/lists/`. Relative "
"paths resolve from the list’s directory. CSV is also supported."

#: ../../resources/usage.md:27
msgid ""
"**Page** 控制每页的行列，`-1,-1` 请求自动布局。**Multiple frames per source** 可在每个来源内连续显示多项，例如 **Per source** 为 "
"`1,3` 时横排三个位置；**Play sources sequentially** 把来源串起来依次浏览。后者也改变挑图范围。"
msgstr ""
"**Page** sets rows and columns per page. Use `-1,-1` for automatic layout. **Multiple frames per "
"source** shows consecutive items from each source, for example three side by side with **Per "
"source** set to `1,3`. **Play sources sequentially** plays one source after another and also "
"changes which images are selected for export."

#: ../../resources/usage.md:43
msgid "复现下图：取消 **Video mode**，用 **Parallel auto** 打开仓库的 `docs/media/example-images`。其中两个子目录各有一张 200 × 200 图片。在线阅读时也可下载 [来源 01](../media/example-images/01/00.png) 和 [来源 02](../media/example-images/02/00.png)，分别存为 `example-images/01/00.png` 与 `example-images/02/00.png`。将 **Page** 设为 `1,2`、**Image unit** 设为 `3,1`、**Display scale** 设为 `1,1`，勾选 **Image**、**Title** 和 **Fit window to image**，保留 **Auto title**，按 **Ctrl+R**。两项的标题分别为来源目录名 01 和 02。"
msgstr "To reproduce the example, clear **Video mode** and use **Parallel auto** to open `docs/media/example-images`. Each subfolder contains one 200 × 200 image. Online readers can download [source 01](../media/example-images/01/00.png) and [source 02](../media/example-images/02/00.png) and save them as `example-images/01/00.png` and `example-images/02/00.png`. Set **Page** to `1,2`, **Image unit** to `3,1`, and **Display scale** to `1,1`. Enable **Image**, **Title**, and **Fit window to image**, keep **Auto title** enabled, and press **Ctrl+R**. The titles show the source folders, 01 and 02."

#: ../../resources/usage.md:53
msgid "找到某一张图"
msgstr "Find a particular image"

#: ../../resources/usage.md:57
msgid "播放卡顿时看什么"
msgstr "Diagnose slow playback"

#: ../../resources/usage.md:59
msgid ""
"把鼠标放在 **Performance & Cache → Power mode** 上，对比实际播放 FPS 与供给 "
"FPS（后台产出可显示页面的速度）。每秒显示一页可以同时更新多路视频，不能把页率乘以来源数当作单路帧率。"
msgstr ""
"Hover over **Performance & Cache → Power mode** and compare playback FPS with supply FPS "
"(finished pages produced per second). Several videos can advance on one page. Multiplying the "
"page rate by the number of sources would overstate the frame rate of an individual video."

#: ../../resources/usage.md
msgid "现象"
msgstr "Symptom"

#: ../../resources/usage.md
msgid "可先调整"
msgstr "What to check"

#: ../../resources/usage.md
msgid "播放均匀，但比预期慢"
msgstr "Playback is steady but slower than expected"

#: ../../resources/usage.md
msgid "查看 **Interval (s)**。手动设定是切换间隔的下限，例如 1 秒最多约每秒翻一页；需要更快时先减小它"
msgstr ""
"Check **Interval (s)**, the minimum time between pages. One second limits playback to about one "
"page per second. Lower it for faster playback."

#: ../../resources/usage.md
msgid "跳转后首屏慢，随后恢复"
msgstr "The first page is slow after a seek, then playback recovers"

#: ../../resources/usage.md
msgid "跳到长视频深处需要寻帧并准备当前页；先用较小预览比例，比较各来源的分辨率和编码"
msgstr ""
"A deep seek requires locating frames and preparing the current page. Try a smaller preview and "
"compare source resolutions and codecs."

#: ../../resources/usage.md
msgid "供给持续跟不上"
msgstr "Supply consistently lags behind playback"

#: ../../resources/usage.md
msgid "从 Balanced 切到 Performance 或 Maximum；如果仍受限，减小预览尺寸、可见算法数或每页图像数"
msgstr ""
"Switch from Balanced to Performance or Maximum. If supply still lags, reduce the preview size, "
"visible algorithm count, or items per page."

#: ../../resources/usage.md
msgid "大体流畅，偶尔等下一页"
msgstr "Mostly smooth, with occasional waits for the next page"

#: ../../resources/usage.md
msgid "**Cache frames** 控制近区，乘以 **Cache multiplier** 得到外层范围。适当增大可利用空闲资源提前准备，代价是更多磁盘读写和空间"
msgstr ""
"**Cache frames** sets the inner radius. Multiply it by **Cache multiplier** for the outer radius."
" A larger window can use idle capacity to prefetch more pages at the cost of disk space and I/O."

#: ../../resources/usage.md:68
msgid "Eco、Balanced、Performance、Maximum 提供不同的 CPU 和内存预算。持续速度还取决于解码、算法、拼接和磁盘。缓存会随浏览位置更新；需要长期保留的结果请导出。"
msgstr ""
"Eco, Balanced, Performance, and Maximum offer different CPU and memory budgets. Sustained speed "
"also depends on decoding, algorithms, stitching, and disk I/O. The cache follows your browsing "
"position. Export any results you want to keep."

#: ../../resources/usage.md:70
msgid "挑图和导出"
msgstr "Select and export images"

#: ../../resources/usage.md:72
msgid "在 **Save Settings** 选择输出目录、输出模式、格式和比例。点击工具栏保存图标或 **Ctrl+S** 后，后台按点击时的设置生成文件，右侧状态栏显示进度。"
msgstr ""
"In **Save Settings**, choose the output folder, content, format, and scale. Click the toolbar "
"Save icon or press **Ctrl+S**. The background export uses the settings at the time of the click, "
"with progress shown on the right of the status bar."

#: ../../resources/usage.md
msgid "输出选项"
msgstr "Output option"

#: ../../resources/usage.md
msgid "得到什么"
msgstr "What is saved"

#: ../../resources/usage.md
msgid "Stitch"
msgstr ""

#: ../../resources/usage.md
msgid "最终画面在 `composed`，各算法的拼接图在 `algorithms/<算法>/stitch_images`"
msgstr ""
"The final page in `composed` and each algorithm’s stitched panel in "
"`algorithms/<algorithm>/stitch_images`."

#: ../../resources/usage.md
msgid "Selected images"
msgstr ""

#: ../../resources/usage.md
msgid "选择结果在各算法的 `select_images` 中，按来源归档"
msgstr "Selected images in each algorithm’s `select_images` folder, grouped by source."

#: ../../resources/usage.md
msgid "Magnifiers"
msgstr ""

#: ../../resources/usage.md
msgid "输出放大区域和带框图。组合模式下，没有框会跳过这一项，其他已选输出照常保存"
msgstr ""
"Magnified regions and images with boxes. With combined output and no boxes, the other requested "
"outputs are still saved."

#: ../../resources/usage.md:80
msgid ""
"**挑选规则。** 单击确定位置，再保存 **Selected images**；右键 **Select image** 是该操作的快捷方式。Parallel auto/manual "
"会从各来源选同一位置，在 Multiple frames per source 下会保留点中的来源内偏移。Sequential、File List 和 Play sources "
"sequentially 只挑当前项；显示算法时也可输出相应处理结果。图像模式的移动选项会移动源文件，首次尝试建议使用副本；视频模式不会移动源视频。"
msgstr ""
"**Selection rules.** Click a position and save **Selected images**, or use **Select image** in "
"the context menu. Parallel auto/manual selects the corresponding position from every source, "
"retaining the clicked offset with Multiple frames per source. Sequential, File List, and Play "
"sources sequentially select the current item only. Visible algorithm results can also be "
"exported. Move files moves original image files, so try it on copies first. Source videos stay in"
" place."

msgid "在同一页比较连续帧"
msgstr "Compare consecutive frames on one page"

msgid "继续使用 Cat 和 Sunset。勾选 **Multiple frames per source**，关闭 **Play sources sequentially**。保持 **Page** 为 `1,2`，将 **Per source** 设为 `1,3`、**Display scale** 设为 `0.35,0.35`、**Skip frames** 设为 `0`。按 **Ctrl+R** 后翻页。左边三格来自 Cat，右边三格来自 Sunset，每组三个帧号连续。"
msgstr "With Cat and Sunset open, enable **Multiple frames per source** and clear **Play sources sequentially**. Keep **Page** at `1,2`, set **Per source** to `1,3`, **Display scale** to `0.35,0.35` and **Skip frames** to `0`. Press **Ctrl+R** and advance a page. The left three frames belong to Cat and the right three to Sunset. Frame numbers are consecutive within each group."

msgid "开启每路多帧、修改行列并翻页"
msgstr "Enable multiple frames per source, change the grid and advance a page"

msgid "给两个来源放大同一处细节"
msgstr "Magnify the same detail in two sources"

msgid "开启 **Layout & Display → Magnifier** 后刷新，点工具栏放大镜。在左图建筑外墙上按住鼠标拖出矩形并松开。两张图会同时出现框，下方各显示来自自己来源的局部。"
msgstr "Enable **Layout & Display → Magnifier**, refresh, and click the toolbar magnifier. Drag a rectangle over the facade in the left image and release. Each image shows a box and its own detail view underneath."

msgid "在左图建筑外墙上画框，松开后两个来源同时显示各自框内的细节"
msgstr "Box the facade in the left image and release to see the corresponding detail from each source"

msgid "用 **Parallel auto** 打开上例的 `example-images`，将 **Page** 设为 `1,2`。两张照片都叫 `00.png`。单击右图，按 **F2** 打开索引表，在 **Visual items** 中点击 **Go to current ID**。选中的应是 ID 2（第 1 页、第 1 行、第 2 列），**Original source** 末尾应为 `02/00.png`。点击 **Copy original source** 可复制路径。"
msgstr "Open the same `example-images` in **Parallel auto** with **Page** set to `1,2`. Both photos are named `00.png`. Click the right photo, press **F2**, and click **Go to current ID** in **Visual items**. ID 2 should be selected (page 1, row 1, column 2), and **Original source** should end in `02/00.png`. Click **Copy original source** to copy the path."

msgid "从主窗口右图定位到索引表中的来源 02"
msgstr "Locate source 02 in the index from the right photo in the main window"

msgid "双击索引行可跳回对应页。要按页或按来源查找，切换到 **Pages** 或 **Sources**。视频帧路径可能先于文件生成；可将当前视图导出为 Excel。"
msgstr "Double-click a row to return to its page. Switch to **Pages** or **Sources** to search by page or source. A video frame path may be listed before the file exists. Export the current view to Excel for offline inspection."

msgid "**跟做一次并行挑图。** 用 **Parallel auto** 打开 `example-images`，关闭 **Play sources sequentially** 和 **Move files**。选择空输出目录，**Content** 选 **Selected images**，**Format** 选 **png**。点右图后按 **Ctrl+S**。等右下角提示保存成功，再用 **Parallel auto** 打开输出中的 `image/algorithms/original/select_images`。应同时看到来自 01 和 02 的照片。"
msgstr "**Try selecting a pair.** Open `example-images` in **Parallel auto** and clear **Play sources sequentially** and **Move files**. Choose an empty output folder, **Selected images** under **Content**, and **png** under **Format**. Click the right photo and press **Ctrl+S**. After the lower-right status field confirms success, open `image/algorithms/original/select_images` from the output in **Parallel auto**. Both the 01 and the 02 photo should appear."

msgid "保存一个位置，再打开输出目录核对两个来源"
msgstr "Save one position and reopen the output to verify both sources"

msgid "导出画质和暂停批量保存见{ref}`保存设置 <export-settings>`。"
msgstr "See {ref}`Save Settings <export-settings>` for export quality and pausing a batch."

msgid "用同一张原图检查算法效果"
msgstr "Inspect an algorithm using one original image"

msgid "取消 **Video mode**，用 **Sequential** 打开 `example-images/01`。选择 **Gaussian Blur**，勾选 **Selected** 和 **Show original panel**。将 **Algorithms** 设为 `1,2`、**Page** 设为 `1,1`，刷新。左右两格现在来自同一张街景照片。开启 **Magnifier** 并刷新，在窗框上取样，比较左侧原图的细线和右侧平滑后的边缘。录屏最后选择 **Stitch** 和 **png**，指定输出目录，按 **Ctrl+S** 导出。"
msgstr "Clear **Video mode** and open `example-images/01` in **Sequential**. Choose **Gaussian Blur**, enable **Selected** and **Show original panel**, set **Algorithms** to `1,2` and **Page** to `1,1`, then refresh. Both cells now use the same street photo. Enable **Magnifier**, refresh, and box a window frame to compare the fine lines on the left with the smoother edges on the right. The recording ends by choosing **Stitch** and **png**, setting an output folder and pressing **Ctrl+S**."

msgid "将同一张照片的原图与模糊结果并排，放大窗框并导出"
msgstr "Compare the original and blurred photo, magnify the window and export"

msgid "在一页对齐算法、来源、时间和局部细节"
msgstr "Align algorithms, sources, time and detail on one page"

msgid "用 **Video mode → Parallel auto** 打开 Cat 和 Sunset，勾选 **Multiple frames per source**。在 **Layout & Display** 从上到下将 **Algorithms、Page、Per source、Image unit、Magnifiers** 设为 `2,1`、`1,2`、`1,2`、`3,1`、`1,2`。勾选 **Image、Magnifier、Title**，将 **Display scale** 设为 `0.3,0.3` 后刷新。在猫咪图上拖出第一个放大框，再到另一处右键选 **Create zoom box here**。选中 **Gaussian Blur**，勾选 **Selected** 和 **Show original panel** 后刷新。"
msgstr "Open Cat and Sunset in **Video mode → Parallel auto** and enable **Multiple frames per source**. In **Layout & Display**, set **Algorithms, Page, Per source, Image unit, Magnifiers** to `2,1`, `1,2`, `1,2`, `3,1` and `1,2` respectively. Enable **Image, Magnifier, Title**, set **Display scale** to `0.3,0.3` and refresh. Drag the first magnifier box over the cat, then right-click another detail and choose **Create zoom box here**. Choose **Gaussian Blur**, enable **Selected** and **Show original panel**, and refresh."

msgid "依次加入连续帧、两个取样框和第二个算法面板"
msgstr "Add consecutive frames, two sample boxes and a second algorithm panel"

msgid "核对最后的画面：上下比较处理前后，每排左边是 Cat，右边是 Sunset。每个来源有两帧，每帧下方并列两个局部。这样一页共有 8 个整帧视图和 16 个局部视图；翻页后，同一位置仍可对应比较。"
msgstr "In the final layout, compare original and processed views vertically. Each row has Cat on the left and Sunset on the right, with two frames per source and two details below each frame. That gives eight full-frame views and sixteen details. The positions remain consistent as you advance."

msgid "录屏保留窗口标题栏、工具栏、设置区和状态栏。首次跟做时，若已有自己的配置，可在 **Configuration** 点 **Save** 留一份快照，再点 **Reset** 从默认布局开始；结束后点 **Load** 取回。开启 **Fit window to image** 和 **Title**，保留 **Auto title**。每个案例给出输入模式和需改的参数，改完按 **Ctrl+R**。控件位置见[设置栏参考](settings.md)。"
msgstr "The recordings include the title bar, toolbar, settings and status bar. To follow from the defaults, save your current settings with **Configuration → Save**, then click **Reset**. Use **Load** afterwards to restore the snapshot. Enable **Fit window to image** and **Title** and keep **Auto title** enabled. Each example gives its input mode and settings. Press **Ctrl+R** after editing. See the [settings reference](settings.md) for control locations."

msgid "![开启每路多帧、修改行列并翻页](../media/walkthrough-frames.gif)"
msgstr "![Enable multiple frames per source, change the grid and advance a page](../media/walkthrough-frames.gif)"

msgid "![在左图建筑外墙上画框，松开后两个来源同时显示各自框内的细节](../media/walkthrough-magnifier.gif)"
msgstr "![Box the facade in the left image and release to see the corresponding detail from each source](../media/walkthrough-magnifier.gif)"

msgid "![从主窗口右图定位到索引表中的来源 02](../media/walkthrough-index.gif)"
